was going to use the wish, I'd get the standard "blessed +2 gray dragon scale
mail".  Great armor and magic resistance counts for more than tossing Mjollnir
around.

>Also I am in Minetown, at the priest with an altar with same allignment as
>me, can I use that for something in this condition?

Yes.  Sacrifice something to make sure god is happy (you'll see some clover,
or nothing; if god isn't ready for you to pray you'll "have a hopeful
feeling".)  If you just got Mjollnir you'll need to wait or sacrifice a while.

Once god is reconciled, drop the water on the altar and pray.  It will be
blessed.  This works at any co-aligned altar; the priest is irrelevant, except
to making converting cross-aligned altars very dangerous.

Bonus if you can find or make more water; multiple vials can be dipped into
one holy water to make more holy water without further praying.

